  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/574642/diamond-spheres-erudition-esoterica\">Diamond Spheres: Erudition &amp; Esoterica</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Sense Motive 5 ranks, Investigation sphere.</p>\n<p>You can adopt this approach as a swift action. While maintaining this approach, you gain thoughtsense up to 60 feet, allowing you to detect and locate conscious creatures within this range—this is considered a divination effect, and is foiled by effects such as <em>nondetection</em> and <em>mind blank</em>.</p>\n<p>Thoughtsense can distinguish between sentient (Intelligence 3 or higher) and nonsentient (Intelligence (1-2), but otherwise provides no information about the creature it detects.</p>\n<p>You can spend 1 use of skill leverage when adopting this approach to have it not count towards your maximum number of approaches.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/investigation#toc46\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
